  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "d14-page-1",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "d14-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Granite Insurance — Q1 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Granite Insurance — Q1 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d14-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d14-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Granite Insurance closed Q1 2025 with a disciplined cost programme and a pricing reset. As a company focused on small-business commercial insurance, the leadership team tracked regional performance, headcount, pricing, service levels and vendor spend against the annual plan, all of which are detailed in the sections that follow.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d14-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Search platform is owned by the Growth team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Zoe Papadakis, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 80.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d14-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The finance team will publish a reconciliation to the statutory accounts after the audit.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 98.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d14-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 116.3
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d14-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Regional results are reported in constant currency. Revenue reflects recognised subscription and services revenue; growth is quarter-over-quarter; churn is logo churn measured at renewal; NPS is the trailing 90-day relationship score.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 130.7
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
